# Native statusline (replaces lightline) / 原生状态栏（替代 lightline）
# Colors come from the mutedstl backend; content/refresh are handled by
# mutedstl itself. Options live in the g:mutedstl#* namespace; there is no
# lightline dependency anymore.
# 颜色来自 mutedstl 取色后端；内容/刷新由 mutedstl 处理。选项位于
# g:mutedstl_* 命名空间；已无 lightline 依赖。
#   g:mutedstl_theme  = ''          " source theme; '' = current
#   g:mutedstl_invert = 1           " swap fg/bg when 1
#   g:mutedstl_fg     = '#D3C6AA'   " explicit foreground
#   g:mutedstl_bg     = 'NONE'      " explicit background
g:mutedstl_invert = 1

# Install the highlight groups and refresh autocmds.  When no 'statusline' has
# been set, Setup() also installs String() as the DEFAULT layout.
# 安装高亮组与刷新自动命令。若尚未设置 'statusline'，Setup() 会把 String()
# 作为默认布局安装。
mutedstl#Setup()

# To use your own layout instead, set 'statusline' BEFORE Setup() (an explicit
# value is never overwritten) and build it from mutedstl's groups, e.g.:
